<section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="kkmi-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="kkmi-title">The Kennedy King Memorial Initiative</h2>
    <p>The Kennedy King Memorial Initiative is a separate nonprofit, founded in 2015, that builds on the events of April 4, 1968, to raise awareness, provoke thought, and inspire action against division and injustice. Its plans would turn the Martin Luther King Park campus into a place where people, institutions, and community partners come together.</p>
    <p>{{ ext("https://www.kennedykingindy.org", "Visit the Kennedy King Memorial Initiative", "btn btn--secondary") }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

